<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Johnson &amp; Johnson.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Johnson &amp; Johnson.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co said in a research note it had raised its two-year price target on Johnson &amp; Johnson stock to $74 from $69 based on the company's inclusion in the Dow Jones Industrial Average.</p>
<p>-- Gruntal's strong buy rating is unchanged, it said.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Johnson &amp; Johnson should now, in our opinion, attract more investors as individuals and money managers construct their own portfolios and try to mimic the performance of the Dow,&quot; Gruntal said.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street Desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
